      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Bm]Arise, [Em]my soul, [D]arise! [Em]Stretch forth [Bm/F#]to [Em]things eternal",
        "[Am]And [Bm]hasten to the feet [G]of your [D]Redeemer [Em]God.",
        "[G]Though hid [Bm/F#]from [Em]mortal [Bm]eyes,",
        "[Em]He dwells in [D]light supernal;",
        "[Em]Yet worship Him [G]in humbleness [Am]and call [Bm]Him Lord.",
        "[Bm]His banquet of [G]love [D]Awaits [Em]you above;",
        "[Em]Yet here He grants a foretaste [G]of the [Am]feast to",
        "[Bm]the feast [G]to come! [Am]Rejoice, [Bm]my soul, rejoice,",
        "[D]To heav'n [Em]lift up [G]your [Bm/F#]voice:",
        "[Em]Alleluia, alleluia, alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Bm]Now [Em]hear [D]the [Em]harps of [G]heav'n!",
        "[Am]Oh, [Bm]hear the song [G]victorious,",
        "[G]The neverending [Bm/F#]anthem [Em]sounding [Bm]through the sky!",
        "[Em]To mortals is not [D]giv'n To join in [Em]strains so [Bm/F#]glorious;",
        "[Em]Yet here on earth [G]we too can sing [Am]our praises [Bm]high!",
        "[Em]He bought with His blood [G]The ransomed of [Am]God;",
        "[Bm]To Him [G]be ever [Bm]lasting pow'r and victory.",
        "[D]And let the great [Em]amenResound [G]through heav'n [Bm/F#]again.",
        "[Em]Alleluia, alleluia, alleluia!"
      ]
    }
